&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– We are a trusted technology partner with deep expertise in cloud, security, data center, AI, and digital infrastructure solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
